WEBVTT

00:00:04.563 --> 00:00:06.606
The champion selection.

00:00:38.054 --> 00:00:41.933
The Durmstrang champion
is Viktor Krum.

00:00:57.824 --> 00:01:00.327
The champion for Beauxbatons...

00:01:00.577 --> 00:01:02.537
...is Fleur Delacour.

00:01:12.964 --> 00:01:15.967
The Hogwarts champion,
Cedric Diggory!

00:01:26.061 --> 00:01:30.565
Excellent! We now have
our three champions.

00:01:30.649 --> 00:01:34.736
But in the end,
only one will go down in history.

00:01:34.986 --> 00:01:38.365
Only one will hoist
this chalice of champions...

00:01:38.657 --> 00:01:41.660
...this vessel of victory...

00:01:41.743 --> 00:01:43.995
...the Triwizard Cup!

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:16.528
Harry Potter.

00:02:18.655 --> 00:02:20.156
Harry Potter?

00:02:24.661 --> 00:02:26.705
No. No.

00:02:27.289 --> 00:02:28.665
Harry Potter!

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:30.625
Go on, Harry.

00:02:30.709 --> 00:02:32.544
Harry, for goodness sake.

00:03:03.908 --> 00:03:05.160
BOY 1:
He's a cheat!

00:03:05.744 --> 00:03:08.204
BOY 2:
He's not even 17 yet!

00:03:23.178 --> 00:03:25.221
[INSTRUMENTS WHIRRING
AND CLICKING]

00:03:36.107 --> 00:03:38.985
MAXIME: It's wrong, I tell you!
MOODY: You French tart.

00:03:39.235 --> 00:03:40.987
Everything is a conspiracy theory!

00:03:41.237 --> 00:03:42.614
DUMBLEDORE:
Quiet! I can't think!

00:03:42.781 --> 00:03:44.866
-Everything is a conspiracy theory!
MAXIME: I protest.

00:03:45.116 --> 00:03:46.242
DUMBLEDORE: Harry.
-I protest!

00:03:46.493 --> 00:03:48.370
Did you put your name
in the Goblet of Fire?

00:03:48.578 --> 00:03:50.705
-No, sir.
-Did you ask one of the older students...

00:03:50.789 --> 00:03:52.123
-...to do it for you?
-No, sir.

00:03:52.374 --> 00:03:55.251
-You're absolutely sure?
-Yes. Yes, sir.

00:03:55.752 --> 00:03:57.837
-But of course he is lying.
MOODY: The hell he is!

00:03:58.004 --> 00:04:00.590
The Goblet of Fire is an exceptionally
powerful magical object.

00:04:00.757 --> 00:04:03.802
Only an exceptionally powerful
Confundus Charm could've hoodwinked it.

00:04:03.885 --> 00:04:05.887
Magic way beyond the talents
of a fourth year.

00:04:06.137 --> 00:04:09.099
You seem to have given this
a fair bit of thought, Mad-Eye.

00:04:09.265 --> 00:04:12.519
It was once my job to think
as dark wizards do, Karkaroff...

00:04:12.769 --> 00:04:14.145
...perhaps you remember.

00:04:14.396 --> 00:04:16.815
DUMBLEDORE:
This doesn't help, Alastor.

00:04:17.524 --> 00:04:19.818
Leave this to you, Barty.

00:04:21.152 --> 00:04:23.405
The rules are absolute.

00:04:24.656 --> 00:04:28.284
The Goblet of Fire constitutes
a binding magical contract.

00:04:29.828 --> 00:04:31.996
Mr. Potter has no choice.

00:04:32.831 --> 00:04:32.833
He is, as of tonight...

